sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: lemma
----
proof:

Given two unequal straight lines, to find by what square the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less.

Let {AB} and {C} be the given two unequal straight lines, and let {AB} be the greater of them.

It is required to find by what square the square on {AB} is greater than the square on {C}.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="200" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.14 lemma diagram" src="propX14l.gif"/></noscript>
