red_highlight: yes
#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If four straight lines are proportional, and the square on the first is greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line commensurable with the first, then the square on the third is also greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a third line commensurable with the third. And, if the square on the first is greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the first, then the square on the third is also greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a third line incommensurable with the third.
----
proof:

If four straight lines are proportional, and the square on the first is greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line commensurable with the first, then the square on the third is also greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a third line commensurable with the third. And, if the square on the first is greater than the square on the second by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the first, then the square on the third is also greater than the square on the fourth by the square on a third line incommensurable with the third.

<div class="just"><a href="#lemma">Lemma</a></div>

Let {A:canvas_1}, {B:canvas_1}, {C:canvas_1}, and {D:canvas_1} be four straight lines in proportion, so that {A:canvas_1} is to {B:canvas_1} as {C:canvas_1} is to {D:canvas_1}, and let the square on {A:canvas_1} be greater than the square on {B:canvas_1} by the square on {E:canvas_1}, and let the square on {C:canvas_1} be greater than the square on {D:canvas_1} by the square on {F:canvas_1}.

I say that, if {A:canvas_1} is commensurable with {E:canvas_1}, then {C:canvas_1} is also commensurable with {F:canvas_1}, and, if {A:canvas_1} is incommensurable with {E:canvas_1}, then {C:canvas_1} is also incommensurable with {F:canvas_1}.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_1" width="210" height="270" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.14 diagram" src="propX14.gif"/></noscript>
