              highlighted: ["C","D","F"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "F found", ref: "Lemma" }] },
            { text: "I say that, if {A} is commensurable with {E}, then {C} is also commensurable with {F},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","E","C","F"] },
            { text: "and, if {A} is incommensurable with {E}, then {C} is also incommensurable with {F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","E","C","F"] },
            { text: "Since {A} is to {B} as {C} is to {D},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D"] },
            { text: "therefore the square on {A} is to the square on {B} as the square on {C} is to the square on {D}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "squares on proportionals are proportional", ref: "VI.22" }] },
            { text: "But the sum of the squares on {E} and {B} equals the square on {A},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","B","A"] },
            { text: "and the sum of the squares on {D} and {F} equals the square on {C}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["D","F","C"] },
            { text: "Therefore the sum of the squares on {E} and {B} is to the square on {B}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","B"] },
            { text: "as the sum of the squares on {D} and {F} is to the square on {D}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["D","F"] },
            { text: "Therefore, taken separately, the square on {E} is to the square on {B}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","B"] },
            { text: "as the square on {F} is to the square on {D}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["F","D"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "separando", ref: "V.17" }] },
            { text: "Therefore {E} is to {B} as {F} is to {D}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","B","F","D"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "sides of proportional squares are proportional", ref: "VI.22" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, inversely, {B} is to {E} as {D} is to {F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["B","E","D","F"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "inversely", ref: "V.7.Cor" }] },
            { text: "But {A} is to {B} as {C} is to {D},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D"] },
            { text: "therefore, ex aequali, {A} is to {E} as {C} is to {F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","E","C","F"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "ex aequali", ref: "V.22" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, if {A} is commensurable with {E}, then {C} is also commensurable with {F},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","E","C","F"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "same ratio, commensurable alike", ref: "X.11" }] },
            { text: "but if {A} is incommensurable with {E}, then {C} is also incommensurable with {F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","E","C","F"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "same ratio, incommensurable alike", ref: "X.11" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, if four straight lines are proportional,",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D"] },
            { text: "and the square on {the first|A} is greater than the square on {the second|B}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B"] },
            { text: "by the square on {a straight line commensurable with the first|E},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","A"] },
            { text: "then the square on {the third|C} is also greater than the square on {the fourth|D}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["C","D"] },
            { text: "by the square on {a third line commensurable with the third|F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["F","C"] },
            { text: "And, if the square on {the first|A} is greater than the square on {the second|B}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B"] },
            { text: "by the square on {a straight line incommensurable with the first|E},",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["E","A"] },
            { text: "then the square on {the third|C} is also greater than the square on {the fourth|D}",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["C","D"] },
            { text: "by the square on {a third line incommensurable with the third|F}.",
              visible: P_ALL,
              highlighted: ["F","C"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "Q.E.D." }] }
        ],
        resolveJustification: function(ref) {
